148	// when the whole fleet is proven done AND has been quiet for a full cycle:
149	//   - the retire pass classified EVERY repo (unknownCount === 0) — an API error
150	//     must not hide a repo still on the legacy shape;
151	//   - ZERO repos still carry its legacy shape (pending.get(id) === 0);
152	//   - the apply pass touched it on NO repo this cycle (appliedThisCycle lacks its
153	//     id) — so the cycle that converges the last member (or crashes mid-apply)
154	//     can never also retire; one guaranteed-quiet apply cycle always separates
155	//     "last application" from "retirement", and a transient false-zero from a
156	//     mid-run crash/delay can't trigger an irreversible delete;
157	//   - it landed strictly before today (>= one nightly cycle old); and
158	//   - it opts into auto-retirement (retire !== 'manual'). A migration whose
